    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“You don’t just sign treaties. You make the world ready to honor them.”</em></p><p>Once per <strong>a Soma Break</strong>, you can ride a crest of goodwill that ripples out into factionspace.</p><ul><li>When your faction next spends <strong>Diplomacy OP</strong> as part of a major negotiation, alliance, or crisis-resolution action during the current strategic turn, reduce that specific Diplomacy OP cost by <strong>2</strong> (to a minimum of 1).</li><li>You must declare that you are invoking Treatywave <strong>before</strong> the OP expenditure is finalized.</li><li>This represents groundwork, secret rehearsals, and a thousand small kindnesses you set in motion beforehand.</li></ul>",
